<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1381084455"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1652371778"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Deep Blue"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="William Black / Monika Santucci"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Pages"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:21.600"><div begin="00:07.253" end="02:48.508"><p begin="00:07.253" end="00:10.869" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Deep blue<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深邃的蓝色眼眸</span></p><p begin="00:14.823" end="00:17.963" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">There were times we would drive 'til the sun broke<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们曾驾车驰骋 直到破晓时分</span></p><p begin="00:18.004" end="00:20.844" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Through the black of the night on a wide road<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">趁着漆黑的夜色 在宽阔的道路上狂奔</span></p><p begin="00:20.854" end="00:26.769" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Paved in dreams, that led me back to you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沿着梦中的道路前行 指引我回到你身边</span></p><p begin="00:27.611" end="00:30.739" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">Lit a spark in the dark, gave me no choice<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在黑暗中点亮火花 让我别无选择</span></p><p begin="00:30.850" end="00:33.621" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">In the night, you're a light in the white noise<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">黑夜之中 你是一道光芒 如白噪音那般抚慰人心</span></p><p begin="00:33.631" end="00:39.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Suddenly, my heart said something new<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">突然之间 我的心发出新的声音</span></p><p begin="00:39.697" end="00:45.861" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">In your eyes, I swear I feel forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你眼中 我发誓我感受了永恒</span></p><p begin="00:45.921" end="00:52.138" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">And I'm falling into the deepest part of you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我渐渐坠入你的内心深处</span></p><p begin="00:52.508" end="00:58.748" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">In your eyes, I feel my heart surrender<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你眼中 我感觉我的心已无力抗拒</span></p><p begin="00:58.885" end="01:02.008" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">As your love breaks through<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你的爱突破重围</span></p><p begin="01:02.774" end="01:06.111" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">I'm lost inside your deep blue<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我迷失在你深邃的蓝色眼眸中</span></p><p begin="01:16.518" end="01:18.729" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Inside your deep blue<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沉浸在你深邃的蓝色眼眸中</span></p><p begin="01:31.675" end="01:34.565" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Passing clouds, skipping stars when I got you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">掠过云彩 跨越星辰 当我拥有你时</span></p><p begin="01:34.844" end="01:37.614" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">In your arms, cover scars like a tattoo<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依偎在你的怀里 就像刺青一样遮住伤疤</span></p><p begin="01:37.624" end="01:43.522" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Rescue me and put back all the pieces<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拯救我 然后让我恢复如初</span></p><p begin="01:44.404" end="01:47.323" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">How did I miss the times that you came through?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我怎么会错过你从前的那些岁月</span></p><p begin="01:47.496" end="01:50.423" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">When every glance was a chance I was blind to<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看到你的每一眼都是我视而不见的机会</span></p><p begin="01:50.433" end="01:56.487" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Now I see you're everything I needed<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在我明白你就是我需要的一切</span></p><p begin="01:56.402" end="02:02.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">In your eyes, I swear I feel forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你眼中 我发誓我感受了永恒</span></p><p begin="02:02.659" end="02:08.696" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">And I'm falling into the deepest part of you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我渐渐坠入你的内心深处</span></p><p begin="02:09.274" end="02:15.438" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">In your eyes, I feel my heart surrender<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你眼中 我感觉我的心已无力抗拒</span></p><p begin="02:15.697" end="02:18.744" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">As your love breaks through<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你的爱突破重围</span></p><p begin="02:19.528" end="02:22.837" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">I'm lost inside your deep blue<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我迷失在你深邃的蓝色眼眸中</span></p><p begin="02:32.334" end="02:35.624" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">I'm lost inside your deep blue<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我迷失在你深邃的蓝色眼眸中</span></p><p begin="02:46.019" end="02:48.508" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Inside your deep blue<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沉浸在你深邃的蓝色眼眸中</span></p></div></body></tt>